# The loops kept over the screens (fixtures/loops: the sweep's save of
# scene 54 and soundout's lba.cfg, the samples on). The
# protopack, actor 2, flies its route with its hum looping, which it
# stops as it lands. Escape opens the quit menu and Return chooses
# Continue, F6 opens the options and Return goes back to the game, and
# H opens the holomap and H closes it, one after the other while the hum
# plays, some 21 seconds after the load, the screens holding the clock. In
# LBA.EXE the first screen stops the hum for good. Set aside and played
# on after each screen, it hums until the protopack lands.
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 3
shot start
sleep 12.5
shot flight
key Escape
sleep 1.5
shot quit
key Return
sleep 1
key F6
sleep 1.5
shot options
key Return
sleep 1
key h
sleep 3
shot holomap
key h
sleep 1.5
shot after
sleep 6
shot end
